    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"brokenness\". it's like... it's just wrong. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize myself because of what i did. it feels like i'm just a parasite on everyone else's life. how can anyone even look at me and see anything good? it doesn't feel like a mistake you can just move past. it feels permanent.",
